#: ../../source/python_api.rst:33
msgid ""
"Run anphon from Python dictionaries, read the HDF5 results, and get "
"phonon frequencies and eigenvectors at arbitrary :math:`q` points."
msgstr ""
"Python の辞書から anphon を実行し、HDF5 の結果を読み込み、任意の :math:`q` "
"点でのフォノン振動数と固有ベクトルを求めます。"

#: ../../source/python_api.rst:36
msgid ""
"The two packages share the force-constant file: ``alm`` writes it with "
"``save_fc(..., format=\"alamode_h5\")`` and ``anphon`` reads it. The "
"script below fits the harmonic force constants of silicon to the "
"displacement--force data of ``example/Si/anharm_IFCs/1_harmonic`` (the "
"64-atom supercell of ``si_alm_opt.in``) and computes the frequencies at "
":math:`\\Gamma` and X:"
msgstr ""
"2 つのパッケージは力定数ファイルを共有します。``alm`` が ``save_fc(..., format=\"alamode_h5\")``"
" で書き出し、``anphon`` "
"がそれを読み込みます。以下のスクリプトは、``example/Si/anharm_IFCs/1_harmonic`` の変位--力データ "
"(``si_alm_opt.in`` の 64 原子スーパーセル) にシリコンの調和力定数をフィッティングし、:math:`\\Gamma` 点と"
" X 点の振動数を計算します。"

